Might be improoved by modding, but the game has major flaws that make it impossible to make the gameplay like old suddenstrike games:
-Max of 8player multiplayer;
-Small ammount of units on the map, can be modded but wont be stable with alot more;
-Very few types of units;
-Limited map size 2x2 modded is still tiny compared to old ss maps;

Pros:
- Combat system is really nice... and thats all.
Cons:
- Crafting is mostly about nothing;
- Not much weapon and armor types;
- Most locations are "corridor" like;
- You can only interact with quests related NPCs and traders;
- Boring loot;
- The world is like static, no feelings that is something happening there;
Do not buy it. Do not let youself to be fooled while looking screenshots and trailer.
The game is not epic, without atmosphere.

Hope this will help other gamers, have fun! ^.^
Bad Bots is the clasical story of machines gone rogue in space and killing people, you being the less experienced in combat, mechanic have to defeat the rogue AI that controls the ship;
Cons:
- map is mazey so you can get lost at some points and you don't have any maps available except a small icon map that appear in 2-3 rooms;
- some areas can get really overwhelmed by mobs so expect some trial and error tactics being used;
- except in some places most of the game is quite easy and a bit boring;
- little variety in enemies;
- nothing special in the plot;
- short story;
Pros:
- variety in guns;
- short story;
- easy to 100%;
- apart from certain rooms, game isn't very challenging;

It is a good game, you will have fun with it.
Pros:
Different fight styles as pure combat, stealth renegade and technomancer;
Intriguing story with a choice of which side to play the last chapter;
a little romance, you can choose between 3 ladies, but as I said it is a little;
Dialogs that you can choose answers that influence the game;
Great art and gorgeously rendered;
Cons:
Some of the answers are not clear as positive or negative, so it is hard to understand if you are being good or bad;
The story shows the bad side of your choices, so there is no good side, just bad and bad;
Just a few weapons and armors;

